# NOT excluded, deliberately: the Dockerfile's build stage is the deploy gate.
# It copies tests/, tsconfig.json, tsconfig.eslint.json, eslint.config.js,
# vitest.config.ts and .lint-baseline.json, then runs the typecheck, the lint
# ratchet and the suite before anything is compiled. Excluding them here made
# `docker compose build` fail outright on
#   failed to compute checksum of ref ...: "/tests": not found
# which took the whole documented deploy path with it. If the gate moves out of
# the image build, remove its inputs from the Dockerfile first and then re-add
# them here — in that order, so the build never references a path this file
# hides.
